fo)}\\n        }\\n    \",ticketButtonText:\"Get tickets\"},settings:{afterCheckoutRedirect:void 0,allowTicketAndMerchSwaps:false,allowUserEdit:true,codesViaLinkOnly:false,disableHumanitixGTM:false,hideAddToCalendar:false,hideArtistPreviews:false,removeImpactCommunication:false,requireEmailConfirmation:false,sendTickets:true,noTicketsMessagingOption:\"none\",showTicketsLeft:false,minimumTicketsPerOrder:void 0,maximumTicketsPerOrder:void 0,seatingMapEditable:false,enableV3SeatMaps:false,waitlistEnabled:false,salesStopped:false,hideConfetti:false,mobileRequired:true},eventModules:[{component:\"richtext\",props:{title:\"Description\",content:\"\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\\\">It’s the return of SKETCHBURN: the sketches of tomorrow, today!\\u003C/span>\\u003Cbr />\\u003Cbr />\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\\\">A ragtag group of comedy writers, directors and performers present works-in-progress of their latest sketch comedy films − curated by Hari Kanth (SNL UK, Horrible Science). The aim: to bring the feedback loop of live comedy to filmed comedy sketches, at every stage of the process:\\u003C/span>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/p>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>📚 \\u003Cstrong>Readings:\\u003C/strong>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#FACADE;--custom-color-dark:#FACADE\\\">\\u003Cstrong> \\u003C/strong>\\u003C/span>staged readings of brand-new sketch scripts\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>🎬 \\u003Cstrong>Rough cuts:\\u003C/strong>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#FACADE;--custom-color-dark:#FACADE\\\">\\u003Cstrong> \\u003C/strong>\\u003C/span>screenings of rough cuts fresh from the edit\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>🍿 \\u003Cstrong>Showcase:\\u003C/strong> screenings of finished sketches, ready to go!\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\\\">As well as listening out for what makes you laugh, there’ll be space for more direct feedback too – so you can help us decide which bits to keep and which bits to burn forever 🔥\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\"}}],artists:[],seo:{jsonSchema:{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"Sketchburn 7: a scratch night for sketch comedy films\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/sketchburn-7-a-scratch-night-for-sketch-comedy-films\",startDate:\"2026-10-28T19:00:00+0000\",endDate:\"2026-10-28T20:00:00+0000\",location:{\"@type\":\"Place\",name:\"Etcetera Theatre\",address:{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",streetAddress:\"265 Camden High St, London NW1 8QR, UK\",postalCode:\"NW1 8QR\",addressRegion:\"England\",addressCountry:\"GB\"}},eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"Once upon a time there was a prince who grew up in a castle with a king who only had sense receptors for his own fear…\",image:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/3e19d5c6-eee0-40b7-9e0c-082246936ef5.jpg@seo-500.jpg\",offers:[{\"@type\":\"AggregateOffer\",offerCount:3,priceCurrency:\"GBP\",availabilityStarts:c,availability:\"InStock\",availabilityEnds:b},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/sketchburn-7-a-scratch-night-for-sketch-comedy-films/tickets\",name:\"General Admission\",price:10,availability:\"InStock\",availabilityStarts:void 0,availabilityEnds:void 0,priceCurrency:\"GBP\",validFrom:void 0},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/sketchburn-7-a-scratch-night-for-sketch-comedy-films/tickets\",name:\"Concessions\",price:7.5,availability:\"InStock\",availabilityStarts:void 0,availabilityEnds:void 0,priceCurrency:\"GBP\",validFrom:void 0},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/sketchburn-7-a-scratch-night-for-sketch-comedy-films/tickets\",name:\" Ticket + signed copy of Another double text\",price:20,availability:\"InStock\",availabilityStarts:void 0,availabilityEnds:void 