>\\u003Cbr />Age: +18\\u003Cbr />\\u003Cbr />Phone bookings incur no booking fees\\u003C/p>\"}},{component:\"video\",props:{title:\"Video\",embedUrl:void 0,url:void 0}}],artists:[],seo:{jsonSchema:{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"LIVE & SPOOKY: A HALLOWEEN SCRATCH NIGHT\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/live-and-spooky-a-halloween-scratch-night\",startDate:\"2026-10-27T19:00:00+0000\",endDate:\"2026-10-27T20:00:00+0000\",location:{\"@type\":\"Place\",name:\"Etcetera Theatre\",address:{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",streetAddress:\"265 Camden High St, London NW1 8QR, UK\",postalCode:\"NW1 8QR\",addressRegion:\"England\",addressCountry:\"GB\"}},eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"Five writers. Five stories. One very haunted evening.\\nStep into the darkness this Halloween for Live & Spooky, Flame Tree Publishing’s first ever Scratch Night.\",image:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/b79b8814-07ac-43e6-9560-25949526db29.jpg@seo-500.jpg\",offers:[{\"@type\":\"AggregateOffer\",offerCount:1,priceCurrency:\"GBP\",availabilityStarts:c,availability:\"InStock\",availabilityEnds:b},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/live-and-spooky-a-halloween-scratch-night/tickets\",name:\"General Admission\",price:10,availability:\"InStock\",availabilityStarts:null,availabilityEnds:null,priceCurrency:\"GBP\",validFrom:null}]},title:\"LIVE & SPOOKY: A HALLOWEEN SCRATCH NIGHT\",descriptions:{default:\"Get tickets on Humanitix - LIVE & SPOOKY: A HALLOWEEN SCRATCH NIGHT hosted by Etcetera Theatre Camden. Etcetera Theatre, 265 Camden High St, London NW1 8QR, UK. Tuesday 27th October 2026. Find event information.\",openGraph:\"Five writers. Five stories. One very haunted evening.\\nStep into the darkness this Halloween for Live & Spooky, Flame Tree Publishing’s first ever Scratch Night.\",twitter:\"Five writers. Five stories. One very haunted evening.\\