 svelte-1g1wad9\" data-flex=\"false\"><p class=\"f-body-2\"><strong>How does it work?</strong></p> <ul class=\"paymentplansmodal-details f-body-2 svelte-9p7u5g\"><li>Reserve your order today and pay over time in regular, automatic payments.</li> <li>You’ll receive your tickets and items once the final payment is complete.</li> <li>No credit checks or third-party accounts - just simple, secure, automatic payments using your saved card.</li> <!--[-1--><!--]--></ul><!----></div><!----> <footer class=\"ModalFooter svelte-1y1b7pd\" data-surface=\"background\"><!----><button data-variant=\"secondary\" data-size=\"m\" class=\"Btn  svelte-17nnmqu f-label-3\" type=\"button\" aria-disabled=\"false\" data-loading=\"false\"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->Close<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></button><!----><!----></footer><!----><!----></div> <button class=\"ModalCloseButton svelte-t3wwh4\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close dialog\" data-trap-boundary=\"last\" data-button-style=\"flat\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 15\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" class=\"CrossIcon\" aria-label=\"Cross icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><title>Close icon</title><path d=\"M11.782 4.032a.575.575 0 1 0-.813-.814L7.5 6.687 4.032 3.218a.575.575 0 0 0-.814.814L6.687 7.5l-3.469 3.468a.575.575 0 0 0 .814.814L7.5 8.313l3.469 3.469a.575.575 0 0 0 .813-.814L8.313 7.5l3.469-3.468Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><!----><span class=\"u-visually-hidden\">Close</span></button><!----><!----></dialog><!----> <main class=\"EventPage svelte-9qsyhv\" id=\"main\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"event-title\"><!--[0--><div class=\"Hero svelte-1rb6n7y\" data-theme=\"default\"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class=\"banner svelte-1rb6n7y\"><picture class=\"Image  svelte-uzlrqx\"><!--[0--><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"https://images.humanitix.co