ge, award-winning magic show Wish returns to Etcetera Theatre!\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">The show delivers everything you expect from world-class magic: mind-reading, impossible objects, and highly interactive illusions; while introducing unique magical eﬀects from ancient Chinese, never seen outside of China.\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">\\\"Fantastic Show\\\" - Northamptonshire Magicians' Club\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">\\\"Utterly Entertaining\\\" - UCL Magic Society\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">A feel-good and captivating show, the show oﬀers an evening of laughter, storytelling, and unforgettable magic audiences won’t have seen before and anywhere else.\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">\\u003Cstrong>Age restrictions\\u003C/strong>: 12 and above.\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\"}}],artists:[],seo:{jsonSchema:{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"Wish\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/wish\",startDate:\"2026-09-12T21:00:00+0100\",endDate:\"2026-09-24T22:00:00+0100\",location:{\"@type\":\"Place\",name:\"Etcetera Theatre\",address:{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",streetAddress:\"265 Camden High St, London NW1 8QR, UK\",postalCode:\"NW1 8QR\",addressRegion:\"England\",addressCountry:\"GB\"}},eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"As seen at Edinburgh Fringe, award-winning magic show Wish returns to Etcetera Theatre!\",image:\"https://images.humanitix.c