n class=\"ModalCloseButton svelte-t3wwh4\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close dialog\" data-trap-boundary=\"last\" data-button-style=\"flat\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 15\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" class=\"CrossIcon\" aria-label=\"Cross icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><title>Close icon</title><path d=\"M11.782 4.032a.575.575 0 1 0-.813-.814L7.5 6.687 4.032 3.218a.575.575 0 0 0-.814.814L6.687 7.5l-3.469 3.468a.575.575 0 0 0 .814.814L7.5 8.313l3.469 3.469a.575.575 0 0 0 .813-.814L8.313 7.5l3.469-3.468Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><!----><span class=\"u-visually-hidden\">Close</span></button><!----><!----></dialog><!----></div><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class=\"EventModules svelte-r64kdn\"><!--[--><!--[0--><!--[9--><div class=\"EventModuleRichText svelte-6ayzyh\"><!--[0--><h2 class=\"title f-heading-4 svelte-6ayzyh\">Description</h2><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"RichContent f-body-3 svelte-jgfn07\"><!--[0--><!----><p><strong>Two Man Theatre Company presents</strong></p><p>Nothing and nobody will stop Roy Tunt from spotting his wild birds. On a stormy December morning on England's desolate east coast, Roy is on a very special mission: to record all 567 species on the British List.</p><p>With conditions perfect for spotting the rare and beautiful Sociable Plover, Roy sequesters himself in a bird-spotter's hide on a flooded stretch of marshland. Armed with a packed lunch and a framed photograph of his ex-wife, he watches and waits.</p><p>But might he have other plans? And who is the tall, dark and handsome stranger battling through the flood waters towards him?</p><p>All will be revealed inside the hide...</p><p>The Sociable Plover is presented by arrangement with Concord Theatricals Ltd. on behalf of Samuel French Ltd.</p><p><strong>Age Guidance</strong><br />14+ (Mild Violence)</p><p><strong>Socials</strong><br />Instagram – 2_man_theat