!----> <div class=\"Collapsible svelte-ytl67q\" data-expanded=\"false\" style=\"--collapsed-height: 240px\" data-collapse-necessary=\"false\"><div class=\"inner\"><div class=\"text f-label-3\"><div class=\"RichContent f-body-3 svelte-jgfn07\"><!--[0--><!----><p><strong>Etcetera Theatre</strong> is an award-winning 42-seat black box theatre in the heart of Camden Town, London.</p><p>Since 1986, we have supported emerging and established artists across theatre, comedy, new writing, festivals, workshops and experimental performance.</p><p>We programme year-round, including Camden Fringe, VOILÀ! Theatre Festival, Women Writers Festival, Camden Horror Fest, Edinburgh Fringe previews, artist development slots and independent productions.</p><p>Our venue offers:</p><ul><li><p>42-seat intimate theatre space</p></li><li><p>central Camden location</p></li><li><p>box office operation</p></li><li><p>front-of-house support</p></li><li><p>marketing support</p></li><li><p>livestreaming and hybrid event capability</p></li><li><p>rehearsal, workshop and performance hire</p></li></ul><p>We are committed to supporting bold, independent performance and helping artists reach audiences both in the room and beyond it.</p><p><strong>42 seats. Unlimited reach.</strong></p><!----><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></aside><!----> <!--[0--><aside class=\"EventKeywords svelte-12d6v78\" aria-labelledby=\"EventKeywords-title\"><h2 class=\"f-heading-3 svelte-12d6v78\" id=\"EventKeywords-title\">Keywords</h2> <ul class=\"keywords svelte-12d6v78\"><!--[--><!--[0--><!----><li class=\"Badge f-label-2 svelte-3om6mv\" data-surface=\"sunken\" data-text=\"medium\">theatre<!----></li><!----><!--]--><!--[0--><!----><li class=\"Badge f-label-2 svelte-3om6mv\" data-surface=\"sunken\" data-text=\"medium\">camden<!----></li><!----><!--]--><!--[0--><!----><li class=\"Badge f-label-2 svelte-3om6mv\" data-surface=\"sunken\" data-text=\"medium\">london<!----></li><!----><!--]--><!--[0--><!----><li class=\"Badge f-label-2 svelte-3om6mv\" data-surface=\"sunken\" data-text=\"medium\">show<!----></li><!----><!--]--><!--[0--><!----><li class=\"Badge f-label-2 svelte-3om6mv\" data-surface=\"sunken\" data-text=\"medium\">fringe<!----></li><!----><!--]--><!--]--></ul></aside><!--]--></div> <div class=\"fixedwrapper svelte-9qsyhv\" data-sticky-bottom-in-iframe=\"\"><div data-sticky-bottom-in-iframe-target=\"\"><section class=\"EventGetTickets svelte-1kcegs9\" data-surface=\"background\" data-skip-target=\"tickets\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"get-tickets-label\"><h2 id=\"get-tickets-label\" class=\"u-visually-hidden\">Get tickets</h2> <!--[0--><span class=\"f-label-2-thin\">Sales have stopped</span><!--]--> <!----><button data-variant=\"primary\" data-size=\"l\" class=\"Btn  svelte-17nnmqu f-label-3\" type=\"button\" aria-disabled=\"true\" data-testid=\"get-tickets-btn\" data-loading=\"false\"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->Get tickets<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></button><!----><!----></section><!----></div></div> <div class=\"stickytrack svelte-9qsyhv\" data-sticky-top-in-iframe-track=\"\"><div class=\"stickywrapper svelte-9qsyhv\" data-sticky-top-in-iframe=\"\"><section class=\"EventGetTickets svelte-1kcegs9\" data-surface=\"background\" data-skip-target=\"tickets\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"get-tickets-label\"><h2 id=\"get-tickets-label\" class=\"u-visually-hidden\">Get tickets</h2> <!--[0--><span class=\"f-label-2-thin\">Sales have stopped</span><!--]--> <!----><button data-variant=\"primary\" data-size=\"l\" class=\"Btn  svelte-17nnmqu f-label-3\" type=\"button\" aria-disabled=\"true\" data-testid=\"get-tickets-btn\" data-loading=\"false\"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->Get tickets<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></button><!----><!----></section><!----> <!--[-1--><