:var(--colorv3-sunken-text-low);\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t--colorv3-current-text-disabled:var(--colorv3-sunken-text-disabled);\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t--colorv3-current-text-primary:var(--colorv3-sunken-text-primary);\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t--colorv3-current-text-success:var(--colorv3-sunken-text-success);\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t--colorv3-current-text-error:var(--colorv3-sunken-text-error);\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t--colorv3-current-text-warning:var(--colorv3-sunken-text-warning);\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t--colorv3-current-text-info:var(--colorv3-sunken-text-info);\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t--colorv3-current-border:var(--colorv3-sunken-border);\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tbackground:var(--colorv3-sunken-base);color:var(--colorv3-current-text-high);\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t\\t[data-surface*=\\\"sunken\\\"][data-surface*=\\\"interactive\\\"]:hover{background:var(--colorv3-sunken-hover)}\\n\\t\\t\\t[data-surface*=\\\"sunken\\\"][data-surface*=\\\"interactive\\\"]:active{background:var(--colorv3-sunken-active)}\\n\\t\\n\\n\\t[data-text=\\\"high\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-high)}\\n\\t[data-text=\\\"medium\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-medium)}\\n\\t[data-text=\\\"low\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-low)}\\n\\t[data-text=\\\"disabled\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-disabled)}\\n\\t[data-text=\\\"primary\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-primary)}\\n\\t[data-text=\\\"success\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-success)}\\n\\t[data-text=\\\"error\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-error)}\\n\\t[data-text=\\\"warning\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-warning)}\\n\\t[data-text=\\\"info\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-info)}\\n        }\\n    \",ticketButtonText:\"Get tickets\"},settings:{afterCheckoutRedirect:void 0,allowTicketAndMerchSwaps:false,allowUserEdit:true,codesViaLinkOnly:false,disableHumanitixGTM:false,hideAddToCalendar:false,hideArtistPreviews:false,removeImpactCommunication:false,requireEmailConfirmation:false,sendTickets:true,noTicketsMessagingOption:\"none\",showTicketsLeft:false,minimumTicketsPerOrder:void 0,maximumTicketsPerOrder:void 0,seatingMapEditable:false,enableV3SeatMaps:false,waitlistEnabled:false,salesStopped:true,hideConfetti:false,mobileRequired:true},eventModules:[{component:\"richtext\",props:{title:\"Description\",content:\"\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong>Two Man Theatre Company presents\\u003C/strong>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>Nothing and nobody will stop Roy Tunt from spotting his wild birds. On a stormy December morning on England's desolate east coast, Roy is on a very special mission: to record all 567 species on the British List.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>With conditions perfect for spotting the rare and beautiful Sociable Plover, Roy sequesters himself in a bird-spotter's hide on a flooded stretch of marshland. Armed with a packed lunch and a framed photograph of his ex-wife, he watches and waits.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>But might he have other plans? And who is the tall, dark and handsome stranger battling through the flood waters towards him?\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>All will be revealed inside the hide...\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>The Sociable Plover is presented by arrangement with Concord Theatricals Ltd. on behalf of Samuel French Ltd.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong>Age Guidance\\u003C/strong>\\u003Cbr />14+ (Mild Violence)\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong>Socials\\u003C/strong>\\u003Cbr />Instagram – 2_man_theatre\\u003C/p>\"}}],artists:[],seo:{jsonSchema:{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"The Sociable Plover\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/the-sociable-plover\",startDate:\"2026-09-24T19:00:00+0100\",endDate:\"2026-09-26T20:00:00+0100\",location:{\"@type\":\"Place\",name:\"Etcetera Theatre\",address:{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",streetAddress:\"265 Camden High St, London NW1 8QR, UK\",postalCode:\"NW1 8QR\",addressRegion:\"England\",addressCountry:\"GB\"}},eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"Nothing and nobody will stop Roy Tunt from spotting his w