6ZM12.56 7.982h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM13.92 7.982h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM15.28 7.982H14.2v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM12.56 6.545h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM13.92 6.545h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM15.28 6.545H14.2v1.16h1.08v-1.16Z\" fill=\"#1976D2\"></path></svg><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->Outlook web<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></button><!----><!----></li> <li class=\"svelte-5h8gi0\"><!----><button data-variant=\"secondary\" data-size=\"m\" class=\"Btn  svelte-17nnmqu f-label-3\" type=\"button\" aria-disabled=\"true\" data-loading=\"false\"><!--[0--><div class=\"right-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[1--><!--[--><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M10.1 4.1h5.813c.324 0 .587.263.587.587v7.626a.587.587 0 0 1-.587.587H10.1V4.1Z\" fill=\"#1976D2\"></path><path d=\"M15.7 6.083h-5.6V12.3h5.6V6.083Z\" fill=\"#fff\"></path><path d=\"M9.7 16.5.5 14.7V2.3L9.7.5v16Z\" fill=\"#1976D2\"></path><path d=\"M5 5.5c-1.27 0-2.3 1.343-2.3 3s1.03 3 2.3 3c1.27 0 2.3-1.343 2.3-3s-1.03-3-2.3-3Zm-.1 4.8c-.663 0-1.2-.806-1.2-1.8s.537-1.8 1.2-1.8c.663 0 1.2.806 1.2 1.8s-.537 1.8-1.2 1.8Z\" fill=\"#fff\"></path><path d=\"M11.199 10.795h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM12.56 10.795h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM13.92 10.795h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM11.199 9.364h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM12.56 9.364h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM13.92 9.364h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM15.28 9.364H14.2v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM11.199 7.982h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM12.56 7.982h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM13.92 7.982h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM15.28 7.982H14.2v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM12.56 6.545h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM13.92 6.545h-1.08v1.16h1.08v-1.16ZM15.28 6.545H14.2v1.16h1.08v-1.16Z\" fill=\"#1976D2\"></path></svg><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->Outlook desktop<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></button><!----><!----></li> <li class=\"svelte-5h8gi0\"><!----><button data-variant=\"secondary\" data-size=\"m\" class=\"Btn  svelte-17nnmqu f-label-3\" type=\"button\" aria-disabled=\"true\" data-loading=\"false\"><!--[0--><div class=\"right-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[1--><!--[--><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M.501 4.395h3.433l1.998 5.113 2.025-5.113H11.3L6.267 16.5H2.903l1.378-3.208L.5 4.395Zm14.69 4.086h-3.744L14.77.5h3.73L15.19 8.48Zm-2.763.764a2.08 2.08 0 1 1 0 4.158 2.08 2.08 0 0 1 0-4.158Z\" fill=\"#5F01D1\"></path></svg><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->Yahoo<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></button><!----><!----></li></ul><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----></div> <button class=\"ModalCloseButton svelte-t3wwh4\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close dialog\" data-trap-boundary=\"last\" data-button-style=\"flat\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 15\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" class=\"CrossIcon\" aria-label=\"Cross icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><title>Close icon</title><path d=\"M11.782 4.032a.575.575 0 1 0-.813-.814L7.5 6.687 4.032 3.218a.575.575 0 0 0-.814.814L6.687 7.5l-3.469 3.468a.575.575 0 0 0 .814.814L7.5 8.313l3.469 3.469a.575.575 0 0 0 .813-.814L8.313 7.5l3.469-3.468Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><!----><span class=\"u-visually-hidden\">Close</span></button><!----><!----></dialog><!----></div><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class=\"EventModules svelte-r64kdn\"><!--[--><!--[0--><!--[9--><div class=\"EventModuleRichText svelte-6ayzyh\"><!--[0--><h2 class=\"title f-heading-4 svelte-6ayzyh\">Description</h2><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"RichContent f-body-3 svelte-jgfn07\"><!--[0--><!----><p><em>A man who speaks in verse is either trying to sell you something or hide a body.</em></p><p></p><p>It’s 7pm and rehearsal is finished for the day. A janitor alone on stage finds himself possessed by minor Shakespearean characters unhappy with their lot in the original plays. No longer waiting in the wings, they begin to ask the question: can you achieve true agency when your life has been written already?</p><p></p><p><em>And so I thought my thought was free,</em></p><p><em>But shackled so, how can it be?</em></p><p></p><p>Understudy No. 5 is a monologue cycle of possession and inversion - the perfect show for clowns, philosophers, and Shakespeare nerds alike. Across one hour, Fifth Folio Theatre’s debut production uncovers the stories taking place behind the scenes of the plays we know all too well.</p><p></p><p><em>If a jest be infinite, it hath no end. If it hath no end, there is no time for the laughter to begin. Argal, an infinite jest is entirely unfunny.</em></p><p></p><p>Written and performed by Hadrian Conyngham</p><p>Directed by Warren Rusher</p><p>Movement Coordination by Dan Hardwell</p><p>Presented by Fifth Folio Theatre</p><p>Photos by Harry Chapman</p><p>Poster Design by Jonty Davies-Conyngham</p><p>-----</p><p></p><p><strong>Reviews for Understudy No. 5</strong></p><p></p><p>\"Shakespeare must hand his crown to Conyngham.\" - The Reviews Hub ⭐<span style=\"--custom-color-light:#FACADE;--custom-color-dark:#FACADE\">⭐⭐⭐</span></p><p></p><p>\"It’s a rare and joyous thing to see a creative riff on Shakespeare’s plays that is not only deeply invested in their stories but shows just as much appreciation for the language in which they are told.\" - Arts Review Hub ⭐<span style=\"--custom-color-light:#FACADE;--custom-color-dark:#FACADE\">⭐⭐⭐</span></p><p></p><p>\"Understudy No. 5 is an intelligent, playful and unusually thoughtful encounter with Shakespeare, strengthened by a committed solo performance from Conyngham.\" - Theatre Life ⭐<span style=\"--custom-color-light:#FACADE;--custom-color-dark:#FACADE\">⭐⭐⭐</span></p><p></p><p>“Laughter erupts from a glance alone…Physicality textures every moment; with Dan Hardwell as Movement Coordinator, the production blurs the line between mind and body in Hadrian’s psychophysical performance.” - Elementary WhatsOn</p><p></p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://instagram.com/fifthfolio\"><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#FACADE;--custom-color-dark:#FACADE\"><strong>instagram.com/fifthfolio</strong></span></a></p><p></p><p><strong>Recommended 14+ at audience's discretion. Content warnings: dementia, panic attacks, death.</strong></p><!----><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--[0--><!--[11--><div class=\"EventModuleVideo\"><!--[0--><h2 class=\"title f-heading-4 svelte-5nrv99\">Video</h2><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class=\"wrapper svelte-5nrv99\" data-platform=\"default\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mKBpcFDo0EA\" title=\"Video\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"svelte-5nrv99\"></iframe></div><!--]--></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class=\"HumanitixBannerLarge svelte-17kav4o\"><div class=\"logos svelte-17kav4o\"><span class=\"powered-by f-label-1 svelte-17kav4o\">Powered by</span> <svg class=\"HumanitixLogoSvg svelte-pxa59x\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 139 34\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><title>Humanitix logo</title><g><!--[-1--><!--]--><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12.37 23.84c-1.06 0-1.62-.57-1.62-1.63v-2.73a.66.66 0 0 0-.72-.72H6.35a.66.66 0 0 0-.72.72v2.73c0 1.06-.56 1.63-1.62 1.63H1.62C.56 23.84 0 23.27 0 22.2v-10.2c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.4c1.05 0 1.61.56 1.61 1.62v1.84a.66.66 0 0 0 .72.72h3.68a.66.66 0 0 0 .72-.72v-1.84c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.4c1.05 0 1.61.56 1.61 1.62v10.2c0 1.06-.56 1.63-1.62 1.63h-2.4ZM19.05 20.53v-8.52c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.2c1.06 0 1.62.56 1.62 1.62v6.67c0 .92.67 1.02 1.18 1.02.52 0 1.03-.03 1.54-.1a.68.68 0 0 0 .66-.75V12c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1