fb13ed\",userId:\"5fTM5EeINmYTQIdMw0e5re2pDGy2\",slug:\"etcetera-theatre-camden\",urls:{url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/host/etcetera-theatre-camden\",shareUrl:\"https://events.humanitix.com/host/etcetera-theatre-camden\"},logo:{imageId:\"e127d412-9b79-4ca9-983a-41d01584b9f7.png\",src:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/e127d412-9b79-4ca9-983a-41d01584b9f7.png@original\",alt:\"Etcetera Theatre Camden's logo\",width:250,height:250},website:\"https://etceteratheatrecamden.com/\",socials:[{href:\"https://etceteratheatrecamden.com/\",network:\"Website\",name:void 0},{href:\"https://www.instagram.com/etcetera_theatre_camden/\",network:\"Instagram\",name:void 0}],followers:44,banner:{imageId:\"e215646f-ab23-4a51-a638-3a75c0807279.png\",src:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/e215646f-ab23-4a51-a638-3a75c0807279.png@original\",alt:\"Etcetera Theatre Camden's banner\",width:1600,height:800},description:\"\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong>Etcetera Theatre\\u003C/strong> is an award-winning 42-seat black box theatre in the heart of Camden Town, London.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>Since 1986, we have supported emerging and established artists across theatre, comedy, new writing, festivals, workshops and experimental performance.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>We programme year-round, including Camden Fringe, VOILÀ! Theatre Festival, Women Writers Festival, Camden Horror Fest, Edinburgh Fringe previews, artist development slots and independent productions.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>Our venue offers:\\u003C/p>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>42-seat intimate theatre space\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>central Camden location\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>box office operation\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>front-of-house support\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>marketing support\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>livestreaming and hybrid event capability\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>rehearsal, workshop and performance hire\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cp>We are committed to 