sIcon\" aria-label=\"Cross icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><title>Close icon</title><path d=\"M11.782 4.032a.575.575 0 1 0-.813-.814L7.5 6.687 4.032 3.218a.575.575 0 0 0-.814.814L6.687 7.5l-3.469 3.468a.575.575 0 0 0 .814.814L7.5 8.313l3.469 3.469a.575.575 0 0 0 .813-.814L8.313 7.5l3.469-3.468Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><!----><span class=\"u-visually-hidden\">Close</span></button><!----><!----></dialog><!----></div><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class=\"EventModules svelte-r64kdn\"><!--[--><!--[0--><!--[9--><div class=\"EventModuleRichText svelte-6ayzyh\"><!--[0--><h2 class=\"title f-heading-4 svelte-6ayzyh\">BABY YOU'LL LIVE FOREVER</h2><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"RichContent f-body-3 svelte-jgfn07\"><!--[0--><!----><p>Join us for the debut performance of BABY YOU’LL LIVE FOREVER, a one-woman show written and performed by Amelia ‘Mils’ Ryan.</p><p>Blending storytelling, poetry, and stand-up, this special evening invites you into a heartfelt and deeply personal performance.</p><p>Doors open at 6pm for pre-show drinks, the show begins at 7pm, followed by post-show drinks, conversation, and books available until close.</p><p>You can also pre-order your exclusive Baby Bundle to collect on the night. Each bundle includes a copy of the BABY YOU’LL LIVE FOREVER poetry collection, The Story of Seb + Amelia zine, and an A4 poetry print.</p><p></p><p><strong>BABY YOU’LL LIVE FOREVER </strong>is an unflinching one-woman show that weaves poetry, storytelling, and stand-up into a raw act of confession.</p><p>At its heart is the obsessive, almost two-decade-long entanglement of Seb &amp; Amelia - equal parts intoxicating and destructive.</p><p>Amelia revisits the moments that broke her, the patterns that kept her stuck, and the truth she could no longer outrun.</p><p>What unfolds is a charged, intimate experience where grief collides with laughter, and vulnerability becomes power.</p><p>This isn’t just another story about heartbreak—it’s about breaking the cycle and rewriting the ending.</p><p></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#202020;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\"><strong>Exclusive Collector’s Baby Bundle</strong></span><br /><br /><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#202020;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\">Take home a piece of BABY YOU’LL LIVE FOREVER with this exclusive collector’s ‘Baby Bundle’, featuring:</span><br /><br /><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#202020;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\">• A first edition copy of BABY YOU’LL LIVE FOREVER</span><br /><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#202020;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\">• The Story of Seb &amp; Amelia companion zine</span><br /><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#202020;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\">• An exclusive signed A4 poetry print</span><br /><br /><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#202020;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\">Available to pre-order for collection on the night of the debut performance.</span></p><!----><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class=\"HumanitixBannerLarge svelte-17kav4o\"><div class=\"logos svelte-17kav4o\"><span class=\"powered-by f-label-1 svelte-17kav4o\">Powered by</span> <svg class=\"HumanitixLogoSvg svelte-pxa59x\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 139 34\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><title>Humanitix logo</title><g><!--[-1--><!--]--><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12.37 23.84c-1.06 0-1.62-.57-1.62-1.63v-2.73a.66.66 0 0 0-.72-.72H6.35a.66.66 0 0 0-.72.72v2.73c0 1.06-.56 1.63-1.62 1.63H1.62C.56 23.84 0 23.27 0 22.2v-10.2c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.4c1.05 0 1.61.56 1.61 1.62v1.84a.66.66 0 0 0 .72.72h3.68a.66.66 0 0 0 .72-.72v-1.84c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.4c1.05 0 1.61.56 1.61 1.62v10.2c0 1.06-.56 1.63-1.62 1.63h-2.4ZM19.05 20.53v-8.52c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.2c1.06 0 1.62.56 1.62 1.62v6.67c0 .92.67 1.02 1.18 1.02.52 0 1.03-.03 1.54-.1a.68.68 0 0 0 .66-.75V12c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.23c1.06 0 1.